{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only a taste of the 100 hellish stages.<br>Can you survive even this small sample of suffering?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u300aCan You Clear All 100 Stages? - Demo\u300b</strong> lets you try out a handful of brutally crafted levels from the full version\u2019s 100-stage gauntlet.<br>With simple controls and devilish design, this demo gives you a glimpse into the challenge, frustration, and satisfaction that define the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t be fooled by the pixel art and cheerful sound effects \u2014 this game is here to destroy your reflexes and test your patience to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83d\udd25 What You\u2019ll Experience in the Demo:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hardcore level design using only two controls: move and jump</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Instant-death, instant-retry gameplay that punishes every mistake</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adorable characters caught in vicious traps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Die. Learn. Perfect your movements.<br><strong>Will your fingers survive even a fraction of hell?</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746460?t=1748088187","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746460?t=1748088187","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746460/22eec94c48c8312ecf6272263c31c1c4cd4cb669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748088187","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746460/22eec94c48c8312ecf6272263c31c1c4cd4cb669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748088187","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Only a taste of the 100 h